# Up the Spout! (levels/solo/spout.txt): up S1's duck shaft and a toot past its trap door, the
# fans, the beat bridge and S2's duck chimney (the old tower); then along to the second duck
# shaft (steer out of its door), the beat ladder (jump as your step goes, land as the next comes)
# and the cushion chimney: zigzag up between the cushions, toot out over the top onto the shelf.
# Then the giant steps: five toots on the shelf, Down (Giant Steps), and up the three steps to
# the plunger.
wait 0.3
hold Right 0.9
hold Right Space 300ms
hold Right 0.6
hold Left 1.0
hold Right 0.4
hold Right Space 150ms
hold Right 0.7
hold Right 0.5
wait 1.0
hold Right 0.4
wait 0.4
hold Right 0.35
wait 1.0
hold Right 0.4
wait 0.3
wait 0.05
hold Left Space 250ms
hold Left 0.35
wait 0.65
hold Left Space 250ms
hold Left 0.15
wait 0.85
hold Left Space 250ms
hold Left 0.15
wait 0.85
hold Left Space 250ms
hold Left 0.3
wait 0.5
hold Left 0.4
hold Left Space 300ms
hold Left 0.6
repeat 3
hold Left Space 100ms
hold Left 0.4
end
hold Left 0.2
hold Right 2.0
hold Right 4.2
hold Left 0.5
hold Right 0.4
wait 1.15
hold Left Space 300ms
hold Left 0.1
wait 0
wait 1.02
hold Left Space 300ms
hold Left 0.0
wait 0
wait 0.94
hold Right Space 300ms
hold Right 0.0
wait 0
wait 0.94
hold Left Space 300ms
hold Left 0.0
wait 0
wait 0.98
hold Right Space 300ms
hold Right 0.0
wait 0
wait 0.94
hold Left Space 300ms
hold Left 0.0
wait 0
wait 0.94
hold Right Space 300ms
hold Right 0.0
wait 0
wait 0.66
hold Left Space 300ms
hold Left 0.0
wait 0
hold Left 1.7
wait 0.1
hold Left Space 200ms
hold Left 0.3
wait 0.2
repeat 5
hold Space 140ms
wait 120ms
hold Space 140ms
wait 0.9
end
tap Down
wait 1.0
hold Right 0.2
hold Right Space 300ms
hold Right 0.1
hold Right Space 200ms
hold Right 0.4
wait 0.3
hold Left 0.0
hold Left Space 300ms
hold Left 0.1
hold Left Space 200ms
hold Left 0.4
wait 0.3
hold Right 0.2
hold Right Space 300ms
hold Right 0.2
hold Right Space 200ms
hold Right 0.6
wait 0.3
hold Right 1.2
wait 2
